an up CSS of doc cards (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6994" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6994</a> refactor: better external link icon positioning (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6989" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6989</a> refactor: extract MDX components (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6985" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6985</a> refactor(theme-classic): remove span wrappers from layout links (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6986" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6986</a> fix(theme-classic): minor code copy button improvements (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6964" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6964</a> refactor: replace text-based copy code button with icons (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6932" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6932</a> refactor(theme-classic): little breadcrumbs improvements (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6914" target=